Coverage and qualification
--------------------------
CALL records across four overlapping source listings: 64.
Classified calls to visible internal code: 6.
Classified calls to library procedures whose instruction bodies are absent: 56.
Calls whose effective runtime target cannot be fully proven statically: 2.

Call count is a count of static CALL instructions, NOT calls actually
performed during the numerical test. It also repeats some calls once
in an object listing and once in the linked executable.
No arithmetic result, error behavior, BLAS kernel instructions or
call-by-call execution frequency is inferred from this static inventory.
